{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "90456452-c1e1-82b2-966c-49fe1b302e20",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T14:10:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Manuel Correia. I got a notice that my payment bounced, the water and sewer one, and I want to know where that stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Correia, I can look that up. Can you spell your last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:07:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "C-O-R-R-E-I-A. Two R's. Look, the money was in there, I don't know what the bank did. [line breaks up] ...second time I'm hearing about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up a little at the end there. Can you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said the funds were in the account. Bank sent it back anyway. I'm in the car, the reception's lousy over here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'm seeing the account now. There's a returned payment noted, and the balance is showing as unpaid again. It hasn't been applied."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's just sitting there open. Wonderful. And I'll tell you, the bill's high anyway. The toilet was running constantly last month, wicked loud, ran all night. I fixed the flapper, but I figure that's why the number's up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could well account for it. A running toilet can add a lot of usage. Once the payment is sorted, if you want the high reading looked at, I can note that on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:08:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, put that down. Now, can I pay it tonight? Online, I mean. City Hall's closed by the time I'm home, and I'm not driving back down there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's an online payment option on the city website, and it works at any hour. There's also a drop box at City Hall if you're ever passing by after closing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online's fine. Do I need the account number off the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You will, yes. It's printed near the top of the bill. If you can't find it, call back tomorrow and we can give it to you once we verify who you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hang on, I'm pulling in somewhere. [crosstalk] Sorry, I'm at the hardware store. I gotta find a lightbulb, the little candelabra size, the small base. You know the cabinet, the milkshake, I'm sorry, the cabinet is what we call a milkshake, a thick one, with ice cream. Anyway, wrong thing in my head. Bulbs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I've heard that one. The bulbs should be in the lighting aisle, I'd guess. Back to your account: is there a late fee on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't see one posted yet. I can't say what happens if it stays open much longer, so I'd pay it tonight if you can. Do you want me to note the usage question too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, note the toilet. And the bounce. So there's a record I didn't just ignore it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. I've noted the returned payment and the high usage from the running toilet. Is 401-555-0174 still the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Though it cuts out, so leave a message if I don't pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. I'll do it tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T14:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Correia. Take care."
    }
  ],
